      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Liver dysfunction is commonly seen in women with Turner syndrome and can manifest in a variety of pathologies. In this review, we discuss the spectrum of liver anomalies associated with this syndrome, and discuss some possible aetiological factors and relationships with exogenous oestrogen."},
